/** * Enum representing policies for message handling in the mod loader system. * *
This enum defines how messages should be treated when processed by the mod loader. * It provides two basic policies: PASS (allow message through) and DISCARD (block message), * along with predefined binary operators for combining policies. * *
Usage example: * @code * MessagePolicy policy1 = MessagePolicy.PASS; * MessagePolicy policy2 = MessagePolicy.DISCARD; * MessagePolicy result = MessagePolicy.ANY_DISCARDED.apply(policy1, policy2); // Returns DISCARD * * * * @since 1.0.0 */
